# Retired prototype-footprint runtime dirs (SH-3). NOT product code — per-host program-data the
# prototype harness writes. The footprint is gone from the tree, but this ignore is kept so a stale
# operator checkout can never accidentally commit prototype program-data or secrets (e.g.
# .co/config.yaml, .co/state.db) after the teardown.
.co/
.claude/
.codex/
